    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Run a Reliability Test\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Make sure your app handles problems gracefully and never looks frozen or broken.\r\n\r\n1. **Break the API URL:** Temporarily change the endpoint so it fails. Confirm your error message appears.\r\n2. **Test Empty Results:** Modify a search or endpoint so it returns zero results. Confirm your empty state appears.\r\n3. **Watch the Loading State:** Click your button and confirm the loading message appears immediately and disappears when finished.\r\n4. **Check for Crashes:** Make sure the app does not freeze, throw visible errors, or stay blank.\r\n5. **Restore Your Endpoint:** Fix your URL and confirm everything works again.\r\n\r\n**Optional:** Take a screenshot of your error state as proof of testing.",
